{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n由香港醫學博物館推出，大受歡迎的聖誕特別版器官與細胞系列掛飾今年回歸啦！系列將於11月1日在香港醫學博物館發售，今年聖誕公仔都有大家的老友：聖誕睪丸、聖誕心臟、聖誕大腦、聖誕腦細胞、聖誕抗體、聖誕紅血球、聖誕白血球。更有新角色聖誕水熊蟲登場！水熊蟲以極端強大的生命力著稱，被譽為「地表最強生物」，因其肥胖圓筒狀的身軀、慢吞吞的步態以及類似小熊的外形，而被俗稱為水熊蟲。每年都好快售罄，大家想要的話要留意住啦！\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334006468697814_6126721146ae432a0e6419.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334006468697814_6126721146ae432a0e6419.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334006679855539_18809784366ae432a312275.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334006679855539_18809784366ae432a312275.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334006840865974_11976111266ae432a49e3a4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334006840865974_11976111266ae432a49e3a4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17933400704436073_2768944076ae432a74942e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17933400704436073_2768944076ae432a74942e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334007484436719_13495735496ae432ab18688.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179334007484436719_13495735496ae432ab18688.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfGweibAZqs/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:25:31.654415+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:44.270608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:20:17.039011+00:00","content_hash":"b9b4255d32e9daa2a7f6493976a477bfd7ec8406c4835794d5d1598652a32535","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}